<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank reverse repo drains 20 bln SKR.</title>
<headline>Riksbank reverse repo drains 20 bln SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Tuesday its morning's reverse repurchase operation drained 20 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at a fixed, unchanged 4.10 percent and will run from January 22 to January 29, replacing an operation that drained 20 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 4.68 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
